        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 “Ai drakhaluai e, nangniw kachy e,”",
            "Kunghpui thai ’thai o, ’seic Jisu khang;",
            "Kathai ’thai makmei chychaengc guay 6_> mu",
            "“Kaipouc laa ganc e,” Jisu saa e.",
            "",
            "“Ai drakhaluai e, nangniw kachy e;",
            "Ai drakhaluai e, Akhou bam o;",
            "Nang laa niimei guay ney o, tiilou ni;",
            "Pu _>6 Ata zian kumc Ai nang ta zian.”",
            "",
            "2 Alat paan _>6 ’taw nangniw nthan the;",
            "Akhou bam ’tip bo, kathai geih khang; ethei",
            "Kauh thangc hymdaihmei dam laa ’chamc ni.",
            "",
            "3 Nang thai _>6 meic nunc nang ta thay puni,",
            "Zianmei khou tat ro, kalaanv na kumc,",
            "Zayloumei pu _>6 chaeng hu tat bam the,",
            "Hymdaih guangcdic khouchaeng zaylou khang."
          ]
        }
      },
